# Read the rule for the files you change

A file-scoped rule is not in the prompt until a matching file is already open, so a new file is written before its rule attaches. Before editing, and again before you finish, read every rule below whose files you touched. `ProjectRuleIndexTest` fails when a file in `.cursor/rules/` is missing from this list.

## Kotlin

Any `*.kt` or `*.kts`: read `kotlin-core.mdc`, `kotlin-naming-variables.mdc`, `kotlin-magic-numbers-detekt.mdc`, `kotlin-detekt-top-level-property-naming.mdc`, and `kotlin-detekt-ktlint-rpi-style.mdc`. Finish with `./gradlew :<module>:detekt`.

`*Screen.kt`, `*Component.kt`, `*Composable.kt`, and `ui/**/*.kt`: also `jetpack-compose.mdc` and `composable-preview.mdc`.

`*ViewModel.kt`, `*Repository.kt`, `*Dao.kt`, `*Module.kt`, `di/**`, and `data/**`: also `android-architecture.mdc`.

## Editor

Any `editor/**` Vue or TypeScript: read `vue3-composition-api-cursorrules-prompt-file.mdc` and `editor-naming-variables.mdc`. The screen-editor shell also uses `editor-preview-first-layout.mdc`. Finish with `cd editor && npm run lint` and `npm test`.

## Context rules

Read the rule whose files you are changing. These describe behavior that is already shipped.

- `map-dialog-player-osm-context.mdc` — map dialog
- `thermostat-component-context.mdc` — thermostat
- `configurable-bars-context.mdc` — top bar and nav bar sizes
- `standby-wake-sources-context.mdc` — wake sources
- `standby-screen-off-context.mdc` — standby countdown and screen off
- `theme-roles-editor-context.mdc` — theme roles
- `session-document-rebuild-context.mdc` — document rebuild versus vars
- `kiosk-lock-context.mdc` — kiosk lock and enrollment
- `nav-icon-paint-context.mdc` — nav icon paint
- `docs-wiki-screenshots-context.mdc` — docs, wiki, and screenshots
- `mockup-ui-match-context.mdc` — mockup chrome
- `camera-dialog-live-video-context.mdc` — camera dialog
- `tile-border-colour-context.mdc` — tile border colour
- `freeform-text-style-controls-context.mdc` — free-form type
- `freeform-layout-parity-context.mdc` — free-form editor and tablet layout
- `freeform-weather-nextevent-context.mdc` — weather and next event
- `ha-weather-icons-context.mdc` — weather icons
- `editor-sliders-and-theme-preview-context.mdc` — range sliders and Day/Dark preview
